{
  "about": "Answers scripts/check-integrations.mjs got from the live services on the date below (UTC), recorded by sending the check's own requests with no credentials. The Trello, Linear and GitLab requests used a made-up key and client id. The Jira redirect's port and nonce are replaced with {port} and {nonce}. The return page's data-pub and data-nonce belong to a throwaway probe key. The bad-state page's body is left out because it repeats the good page's style and script.",
